  "summary": "Fixes socket reading in the `interface_http.py` functional test to properly handle fragmented HTTP responses. Adds `BitcoinHTTPConnection.recv_responses()`, which reads until complete HTTP responses with headers and `Content-Length` bodies are collected. Replaces single `recv()` calls and naïve status-line string matching in test loops with full response parsing.",
